  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1089462272
    m_Localized: Ancient Relay Record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1118822400
    m_Localized: A damaged maintenance tablet from the signal array. The surviving
      fragments may reveal why the relay stopped transmitting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1118822401
    m_Localized: Energy Pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1118822402
    m_Localized: Compact expedition weapon that fires focused energy pulses at unstable
      IO entities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1118822403
    m_Localized: Blue IO Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1118822404
    m_Localized: A condensed anomaly left by a Blue IO entity. It occupies a dedicated
      anomaly slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016704
    m_Localized: IO Integrator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016705
    m_Localized: Dedicated laboratory tool for integrating researched IO anomaly
      stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016706
    m_Localized: NERA Memory Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016707
    m_Localized: A compact NERA data-storage core recovered from the Ancient Outpost.
      Its sealed structure preserves fragmented station records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016708
    m_Localized: NERA Signal Relay Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016709
    m_Localized: A dense relay core recovered from Expedition 02. Its intact routing
      lattice can be analyzed at the station laboratory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016710
    m_Localized: Servo Drive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016711
    m_Localized: Adds a high-torque drive for faster turret rotation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1135599616
    m_Localized: Ancient Outpost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1135599617
    m_Localized: A newly mapped ancient site. Recover artifacts and return to the
      station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1135599619
    m_Localized: Signal Array
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1135599620
    m_Localized: A dormant NERA signal array surrounded by concentrated Blue IO activity.
      Recover the relay core and any surviving records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
